    "ontology/vocabulary URIs",
    "release dates"
  ],
  "assessmentFrequency": "Per dependency update",
  "goodExample": "The release manifest states which ontology version was used (e.g. the EFO release version as listed in OLS).",
  "poorExample": "Terms are used without a version, so obsolete terms cannot be detected."
